{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10028","headline":"乌江女 · 屈同仙","name":"乌江女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越艳谁家女，朝游江岸傍。\n青春犹未嫁，红粉旧来娼。\n锦袖盛朱橘，银钩摘紫房。\n见人羞不语，回艇入溪藏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"屈同仙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}